<title>USA: Telmex sets dividends.</title>
<headline>Telmex sets dividends.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonos de Mexico SA said it declared dividends on its AA, A and L shares of $0.525 pesos per share.</p>
<p>The dividends on American Depositary Shares will be paid in three equal payments of $0.175 pesos per share on June 26, September 26 and December 25 to shareholders of record on June 18, September 17 and December 17.</p>
</text>
